{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Chronomancer: Aeon Rend does not proc from Shifting Chaos AoE (#14022)",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #14022 reports Aeon Rend (583248) proccing from Shifting Chaos AoE (801269) after #13614 added",
    "PROC_ATTR_TRIGGERED_CAN_PROC (AttributesMask 2) to 583248. Because SpellInfo::IsAffected matches any set bit",
    "in SpellFamilyMask and 801269 carries SpellFamilyFlags[1] = 0x1000 (4096) shared with Chromatic Shard,",
    "every Shifting Chaos AoE hit could proc Aeon Rend, casting Chromatic Shard and re-triggering Shifting Chaos",
    "in an exponential loop on clustered dummies.",
    "Fix: drop SpellFamilyMask1 to 0 on 583248 (keeping SpellFamilyMask2 = 33554432 = 0x02000000, unique to",
    "Chromatic Shard ranks, and AttributesMask = 2 for Time Loop #13614) and guard aura_ascension_aeon_rend",
    "with DoCheckProc checking IsChromaticShardRank.",
    "Phase 1 fires 10 Anomaly Spikes (503826) into 6 clustered dummies within 8 yd (~60 Shifting Chaos 801269 hits,",
    "P(0 procs) < 3.2e-8 pre-fix) and verifies 0 Aeon Rend procs and 0 Chromatic Shard casts.",
    "Phase 2 fires 40 owned Chromatic Shard rank 9 (567544) casts with Shifting Chaos active ((0.75)^40 < 1.1e-5)",
    "and verifies Aeon Rend still procs between 1 and 40 times without looping through Shifting Chaos."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "chronomancer",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 22,
      "level": 80,
      "spell_hit_rating": 10000
    }
  ],
